          "title": "孔特征与阵列",
          "summary": "简单孔、沉头孔、螺纹底孔，线性阵列与圆周阵列，孔位定位",
          "estimated_minutes": 70,
          "lesson": "features",
          "prerequisites": [
            {
              "all_of": [
                "extrude-revolve"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fillets-chamfers",
          "title": "圆角、倒角与抽壳",
